{
  "scenario_brief": "TEST: Needs under attack (SIMS-1)\n\nA probe, not a mission. Seven office staff run their needs while the player attacks and knocks them out to see what the needs system and the server do under combat. Ava carries abandoned mugs from the office to the kitchen tray; Ben walks to the kitchen cooler for water and keeps a notebook on him; Dee gets up for an office coffee and watches the floor; Eli never moves, sipping from his own mug, and prints a handover page about six seconds after you ask him for it; Fran and Gil take their breaks together at the kitchen kettle and cooler; Cal is hostile the moment you step into the back room. Read the Meeting Note to call Ben home and suspend his needs, the Meeting Over note to resume them, and the Break Time note to send Ben, Dee and Gil on a break at once. Pick Dee's filing cabinet while she can see you and she catches you. Knock someone out mid-errand and watch what drops; reload and check what survives.",
  "endGoal": "Demo only: attack the staff and watch the needs system and the server cope.",
